<view class="tech-page tech-page--detail"><view class="tech-head"><view><view class="tech-eyebrow">QUOTE DRAFT</view><view class="tech-title">{{editing?'编辑报价草稿':additional?'填写追加报价':'填写初始报价'}}</view><view class="tech-subtitle">选择真实服务项目，按规则清晰报价</view></view></view><tech-state wx:if="{{loading}}" loading /><tech-state wx:elif="{{error}}" error title="报价暂不可填写" description="{{error}}" action="重新读取" bind:retry="load" /><block wx:else><view class="tech-caption quote-context">{{orderNo}}</view><view wx:if="{{!canSave&&!pendingLabel}}" class="tech-notice tech-notice--blue">当前没有编辑报价的权限，请返回查看报价状态。</view><view wx:if="{{pendingLabel}}" class="tech-notice">已保留“{{pendingLabel}}”的原始提交，请先恢复结果。</view><view wx:if="{{editing}}" class="tech-notice tech-notice--blue">编辑需重新选择有效项目和规则，保存后替换整份草稿内容；原审批将失效。</view>
 <view wx:if="{{!editing}}" class="tech-card"><view class="tech-field"><text class="tech-label">检测依据<text class="tech-required">*</text></text><picker range="{{inspectionOptions}}" range-key="label" value="{{inspectionIndex}}" bindchange="onInspection" disabled="{{busy||!!pendingLabel||!canSave}}"><view class="tech-picker">{{inspectionOptions[inspectionIndex].label||'尚无可引用的已提交检测'}}<van-icon name="arrow-down" size="12px" /></view></picker></view></view>
 <view class="tech-section"><view class="tech-section__title">服务明细</view><text class="tech-caption">{{lines.length}} / 100 项</text></view>
 <view wx:for="{{lines}}" wx:key="uid" class="tech-card"><view class="tech-summary-bar"><view class="line-index"><text>{{index+1}}</text> 服务项目</view><button wx:if="{{lines.length>1&&!pendingLabel}}" class="tech-link line-remove" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="onRemove" disabled="{{busy}}">移除</button></view><view wx:if="{{item.oldCaption}}" class="old-line">原草稿：{{item.oldCaption}}</view>
 <view class="tech-field"><text class="tech-label">服务项目<text class="tech-required">*</text></text><picker range="{{serviceLabels}}" value="{{item.serviceIndex}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindchange="onService" disabled="{{busy||!!pendingLabel||!canSave}}"><view class="tech-picker">{{serviceLabels[item.serviceIndex]}}<van-icon name="arrow-down" size="12px" /></view></picker></view>
 <view class="tech-field"><text class="tech-label">价格条款<text class="tech-required">*</text></text><picker range="{{item.ruleLabels}}" value="{{item.ruleIndex}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindchange="onRule" disabled="{{busy||item.ruleLoading||!item.serviceIndex||!!pendingLabel||!canSave}}"><view class="tech-picker">{{item.ruleLoading?'正在读取有效规则…':item.ruleLabels[item.ruleIndex]}}<van-icon name="arrow-down" size="12px" /></view></picker><view wx:if="{{item.rangeText}}" class="rule-price">{{item.rangeText}}</view></view>
 <view class="line-two"><view class="tech-field"><text class="tech-label">数量<text class="tech-required">*</text></text><input class="tech-input" type="digit" value="{{item.quantity}}" maxlength="11" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="quantity" bindinput="onLineInput" disabled="{{busy||!!pendingLabel||!canSave}}" /></view><view wx:if="{{item.feeType&&!item.fixed}}" class="tech-field"><text class="tech-label">所选单价（元）<text class="tech-required">*</text></text><input class="tech-input" type="digit" value="{{item.selectedUnitPrice}}" maxlength="13" placeholder="请输入单价" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="selectedUnitPrice" bindinput="onLineInput" disabled="{{busy||!!pendingLabel||!canSave}}" /></view></view>
 <view wx:if="{{item.feeType&&(!item.fixed||item.feeType==='OTHER')}}" class="tech-field"><text class="tech-label">选价依据<text class="tech-required">*</text></text><textarea class="tech-textarea tech-textarea--small" auto-height value="{{item.pricingReason}}" maxlength="1000" placeholder="说明所选价格的实际依据；超区间需另行申请审批" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="pricingReason" bindinput="onLineInput" disabled="{{busy||!!pendingLabel||!canSave}}" /></view>
 <block wx:if="{{item.feeType==='PART'}}"><view class="tech-field"><text class="tech-label">配件名称<text class="tech-required">*</text></text><input class="tech-input" value="{{item.itemName}}" maxlength="200" placeholder="填写实际使用配件名称" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="itemName" bindinput="onLineInput" disabled="{{busy||!!pendingLabel||!canSave}}" /></view><view class="tech-field"><text class="tech-label">配件规格<text class="tech-required">*</text></text><input class="tech-input" value="{{item.specification}}" maxlength="200" placeholder="型号、尺寸或适用规格" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="specification" bindinput="onLineInput" disabled="{{busy||!!pendingLabel||!canSave}}" /></view><view class="tech-field"><text class="tech-label">配件来源<text class="tech-required">*</text></text><textarea class="tech-textarea tech-textarea--small" auto-height value="{{item.partSourceNote}}" maxlength="1000" placeholder="填写真实来源" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="partSourceNote" bindinput="onLineInput" disabled="{{busy||!!pendingLabel||!canSave}}" /></view></block>
 <view wx:if="{{additional}}" class="tech-field"><text class="tech-label">此项追加原因<text class="tech-required">*</text></text><textarea class="tech-textarea tech-textarea--small" auto-height value="{{item.additionReason}}" maxlength="1000" placeholder="说明此项为何超出已确认范围" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="additionReason" bindinput="onLineInput" disabled="{{busy||!!pendingLabel||!canSave}}" /></view>
 </view><button wx:if="{{canSave&&!pendingLabel&&lines.length<100}}" class="add-line" bindtap="onAdd"><van-icon name="plus" /> 添加服务项目</button>
 <view class="tech-card"><view class="tech-field"><text class="tech-label">{{additional?'追加报价说明':'报价说明'}}<text wx:if="{{additional}}" class="tech-required">*</text></text><textarea class="tech-textarea tech-textarea--small" value="{{changeReason}}" maxlength="1000" auto-height placeholder="{{additional?'说明追加原因及与已确认范围的区别':'补充客户需要了解的报价情况（选填）'}}" bindinput="onReason" disabled="{{busy||!!pendingLabel||!canSave}}" /></view><view class="tech-field"><text class="tech-label">报价有效期（北京时间）<text class="tech-required">*</text></text><view class="expiry-pickers"><picker mode="date" value="{{expiresDate}}" start="{{today}}" bindchange="onDate" disabled="{{busy||!!pendingLabel||!canSave}}"><view class="tech-picker">{{expiresDate}}<van-icon name="calendar-o" /></view></picker><picker mode="time" value="{{expiresTime}}" bindchange="onTime" disabled="{{busy||!!pendingLabel||!canSave}}"><view class="tech-picker">{{expiresTime}}<van-icon name="clock-o" /></view></picker></view></view></view>
 <view class="amount-hint"><van-icon name="shield-o" size="21px" /><view><view>金额由平台规则准确计算</view><text>保存后可查看本次报价、此前已确认及确认后累计应付。此页不预估或自行合计金额。</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{submitError}}" class="tech-form-error">{{submitError}}</view></block><view class="tech-dock" wx:if="{{!loading&&!error&&(canSave||pendingLabel)}}"><view class="tech-dock__hint">先保存并核对金额，再提交客户确认</view><button class="tech-btn tech-btn--primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="onMain">{{pendingLabel?'恢复上次保存结果':'保存报价草稿'}}</button></view></view>
